    <div class="container mt-4">
        This Privacy Policy outlines the types of data collected by Sayori, how that data is used, and your rights
        regarding your information. By using the bot, you agree to the practices described below:
    </div>

    <div class="container mt-4">

        <h2>1. Data We Collect</h2>
        <p>To provide core functionality and enchance user experience, the bot collects only essential data:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Discord Identifiers:</strong> User IDs, Server Ids and Channel IDs - used to identify players
                and servers.</li>
            <li><strong>Gameplay Data:</strong> Scores, wins, losses and progress - stored locally.</li>
            <li><strong>Command's Inputs:</strong> Messages that begin with Bot's prefix(!). all other messages are
                ignored.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do <span class="bold">not</span> collect sensitive personal information such as email adresses, passwords,
            or payment details.</p>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <p>collected data is used exclusively to:
        <p>
        <ul>
            <li>Operate and manage game sessions</li>
            <li>Track statistics and maintain leaderboards.</li>
            <li>Monitor performance and resolve bugs.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do <span class="bold">not</span> use your data for advertising, profiling, or any commercial purposes.</p>

        <h2>3. Data Sharing and Storage</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Your data is <span class="bold">never shared</span> with third parties.</li>
            <li>All data is stored securely on the Bot's hosting environment and it not accessible to unauthorized
                users.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Game data is retained as long as Bot remains active in your server.</li>
            <li>If the Bot is removed, associated data may persist unless a deletion request is made.</li>
            <li>You may request deletion of your data at any time by contacting the Bot owner.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>5. User Rights</h2>
        <p>As a user, you have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Request a copy of your personal game data. </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy inquiries, please visit our <a href="https://discord.gg/rE53UNjK3w"><b>Discord Server</b></a>.
        </p>
    </div>
